{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Big Decisions", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "New Beginnings", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 18, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's backgrounds in a wider variety of communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Modals for Possibility and Necessity", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use modals when you want to express possibility and necessity.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">You use <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, <span class=\"italic\">might</span> and <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to express possibility in the past and in the future.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "*<span class=\"italic\">Might </span>suggests that something is less possible than <span class=\"italic\">may</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">might </span>/ <span class=\"italic\">might not</span> + infinitive</li><li><span class=\"italic\">could </span>/ <span class=\"italic\">could not</span> + infinitive</li><li><span class=\"italic\">may </span>/ <span class=\"italic\">may not</span> + infinitive</li><li><span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> (we do not use <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> in the negative)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Expressing Necessity</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">must </span>or <span class=\"italic\">have to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> to express that something is necessarily true. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">You must tell me your concerns.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You really ought to hear me out. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You must tell me your concerns.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I had better take some more time to consider the negative consequences.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Negative consequences could be caused by this change.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Modal Verbs in the Passive Voice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use modal verbs to add meaning to other verbs. They come before the dictionary form (infinitive without \u2018<span class=\"italic\">to</span>') of the main verb.<br/>Modal verbs can add meaning connected with certainty or obligation.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use modal verbs in the passive voice.  <br/>You use the passive voice when you want to focus on the receiver of the action, rather than the \u2018doer' of the action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here is the structure of a passive sentence:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Subject + to be + past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">More money <span class=\"strong\">is spent</span> by people who don't have children.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can add a modal verb before the <span class=\"italic\">To be</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Subject + modal + to be + past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">More money <span class=\"strong\">may be spent</span> by people who don't have children.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here the sentence now has an additional meaning of possibility, thanks to the modal <span class=\"italic\">may</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I know you must be startled by my sudden decision.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "More families may be brought to the restaurant by this change.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "uneasy ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to feel worried or uncomfortable about something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've been thinking about your plan and I'm really uneasy about it. I don't want you to make a rash decision.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about feelings and reactions.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "startled ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be alarmed and surprised by something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I know you must be startled by my sudden decision but you ought to hear what I have to say.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to hear someone out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to listen to everything someone has to say", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I know you must be startled by my sudden decision but you ought to hear me out.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "adverse ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that is in opposition to one's interest", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You seem confident that more families may be brought to the restaurant by this change but have you thought about the adverse consequences?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to tend to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be inclined toward an idea", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think that people who eat out without children tend to spend more money.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to have a point", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have a valid and logical argument", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You have a point. I had better take some more time to consider the negative consequences that could be caused by this change.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "concept ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a structured and previously thought of idea", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Actually, I haven't discussed my idea with the owner yet. I'll present my concept tomorrow. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "taken aback", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling surprised and confused about something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll present my concept tomorrow. He might be taken aback! Wish me luck!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "eager ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "showing an intense desire to do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You must be eager to share your idea! Good luck tomorrow!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le18ob10aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about feelings and reactions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I speculate about things. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express possibility and necessity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I research on the Internet and present information to a group.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"contents": [{"content": "On the Internet, research major historical decisions (Google search \u201chistorical decisions that changed the world\u201d). ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one decision and research it thoroughly.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make detailed notes on the decision. Be sure to include how the decision was made and if the decision-maker had help from anyone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your information to your class or group.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "_data": [], "template_override": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le18ob10re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le18ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn8le18ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hello?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hi Vanessa. Listen, I've been thinking about your plan and I'm really uneasy about it. I don't want you to make a rash decision.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know you must be startled by my sudden decision but you ought to hear me out. To begin with, I have given this a lot of thought. I've done some research into local restaurant trends.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You seem confident that more families will be brought to the restaurant by this change but have you thought about the adverse consequences?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn8le18ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You must tell me your concerns.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, it's true that this change may bring in more families but think about the customers that don't have kids. I think that people who eat out without children tend to spend more money.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You have a point. I had better take some more time to consider the negative consequences that could be caused by this change. You have got to think I'm crazy!", "id": 2, "time": "25500", "image": "engenn8le18ob10re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No, I think you are ambitious and creative and you had better be appreciated by the owner.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Actually, I haven't discussed my idea with the owner yet. I'll present my concept tomorrow. He might be taken aback! Wish me luck!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You must be eager to share your idea! Good luck tomorrow! Let's meet after you talk to the owner and grab a bite.", "id": 3, "time": "51500", "image": "engenn8le18ob10re2img05.jpg"}]}, "type": "slideshow"}], "title": ""}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about feelings and reactions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can speculate about things and express possibility and necessity.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express possibility and necessity. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How are good business decisions made?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " At work, should decisions be made by one person, or should there be a group discussion first? Why? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Thinking about consequences.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "img_path": ""}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"_d